iv></div><div height="20" width="140" class="sc-1a2d1042-0 gtbgiB"></div></div></div><div class="mt-2 flex flex-wrap items-end justify-end gap-4"><div class="w-full sm:flex sm:w-fit sm:grow"><div class="mt-2"><div flexWrap="wrap" alignItems="flex-start" gap="2" class="sc-9f15bd04-0 sc-9f15bd04-1 iZpldy fkFuSK"></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="sc-d237e6d3-0 cOGHkX"><div data-cy="expense-container-undefined" class="sc-49d236f8-2 dnLKku"><div class="mb-5 flex flex-wrap items-start justify-end gap-3"><div class="flex grow gap-3"><div class="sc-9f15bd04-0 ndwzo"><div width="40" height="40" class="sc-1a2d1042-0 eRYyBq"></div></div><div height="60" class="sc-1a2d1042-0 dvFqrX"></div></div><div class="flex w-full flex-col items-end justify-between sm:w-fit"><div flexDirection="column" minWidth="100" alignItems="flex-end" data-cy="transaction-amount" class="sc-9f15bd04-0 sc-9f15bd04-1 dJNOQz cEToaC"><div height="19" width="120" class="sc-1a2d1042-0 cWhXaN"></div></div><div height="20" width="140" class="sc-1a2d1042-0 gtbgiB"></div></div></div><div class="mt-2 flex flex-wrap items-end justify-end gap-4"><div class="w-full sm:flex sm:w-fit sm:grow"><div class="mt-2"><div flexWrap="wrap" alignItems="flex-start" gap="2" class="sc-9f15bd04-0 sc-9f15bd04-1 iZpldy fkFuSK"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="min-w-64 lg:max-w-72"><div class="sc-9f15bd04-0 cRchhv"><div class="sc-9f15bd04-0 lilXDE"><h5 mb="3" textTransform="capitalize" mt="0" lineHeight="1.15em" font-weight="500" color="black.900" class="sc-c76dea7d-0 sc-c76dea7d-8 iIjnWC">Account balance</h5><div borderLeft="1px solid" borderColor="black.300" pl="3" pb="1" font-size="18px" color="black.500" data-cy="collective-balance" class="sc-c9c4cfee-0 kqwcbF"><div height="28" width="75" class="sc-1a2d1042-0 fsYNPa"></div></div></div><div mt="0,50" class="sc-9f15bd04-0 hlqCry"><div class="sc-c9c4cfee-0 cUgCRG"><p font-weight="500" mb="3" color="black.900" mt="0" lineHeight="1.15em" class="sc-c76dea7d-0 dOGwQA">FAQ</p><div class="sc-95a8602e-5 hCWouZ"><details class="sc-95a8602e-0 efTuIl"><summary class="sc-95a8602e-2 pgoGK"><div>How do I get paid from a Collective?</div><div size="18" class="sc-95a8602e-1 ehjDro"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" height="1em" width="1em" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" data-item="chevron-up" style="margin-top:-1px" class="StyledIconBase-sc-ea9ulj-0 devAbe"><polyline points="18 15 12 9 6 15"></polyline></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" height="1em" width="1em" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" data-item="chevron-down" class="StyledIconBase-sc-ea9ulj-0 devAbe"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></div></summary><div py="2" font-size="13px" color="black.600" class="sc-9f15bd04-0 sc-95a8602e-3 iNnNfP">Submit an expense and provide your payment information.</div></details><details class="sc-95a8602e-0 efTuIl"><summary class="sc-95a8602e-2 pgoGK"><div>How are expenses approved?</div><div size="18" class="sc-95a8602e-1 ehjDro"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" height="1em" width="1em" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" data-item="chevron-up" style="margin-top:-1px" class="StyledIconBase-sc-ea9ulj-0 devAbe"><polyline points="18 15 12 9 6 15"></polyline></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" height="1em" width="1em" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" data-item="chevron-down" class="StyledIconBase-sc-ea9ulj-0 devAbe"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></div></summary><div py="2" font-size="13px" color="black.600" class="sc-9f15bd04-0 sc-95a8602e-3 iNnNfP">Collective admins are notified when an expense is submitted, and they can approve or reject it.</div></details><details class="sc-95a8602e-0 efTuIl"><summary class="sc-95a8602e-2 pgoGK"><div>Is my private data made public?</div><div size="18" class="sc-95a8602e-1 ehjDro"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" height="1em" width="1em" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" data-item="chevron-up" style="margin-top:-1px" class="StyledIconBase-sc-ea9ulj-0 devAbe"><polyline points="18 15 12 9 6 15"></polyline></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" height="1em" width="1em" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" data-item="chevron-down" class="StyledIconBase-sc-ea9ulj-0 devAbe"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></div></summary><div py="2" font-size="13px" color="black.600" class="sc-9f15bd04-0 sc-95a8602e-3 iNnNfP">No. Only the expense amount and description are public. Attachments, payment info, emails and addresses are only visible to you and the admins.</div></details><details class="sc-95a8602e-0 efTuIl"><summary class="sc-95a8602e-2 pgoGK"><div>When will I get paid?</div><div size="18" class="sc-95a8602e-1 ehjDro"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" height="1em" width="1em" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" data-item="chevron-up" style="margin-top:-1px" class="StyledIconBase-sc-ea9ulj-0 devAbe"><polyline points="18 15 12 9 6 15"></polyline></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" height="1em" width="1em" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" data-item="chevron-down" class="StyledIconBase-sc-ea9ulj-0 devAbe"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></div></summary><div py="2" font-size="13px" color="black.600" class="sc-9f15bd04-0 sc-95a8602e-3 iNnNfP">Payments are processed by the Collective&#x27;s Fiscal Host, the organization that hold funds on their behalf. Many Fiscal Hosts pay expenses weekly, but each one is different.</div></details><details class="sc-95a8602e-0 efTuIl"><summary class="sc-95a8602e-2 pgoGK"><div>Why do you need my legal name?</div><div size="18" class="sc-95a8602e-1 ehjDro"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" height="1em" width="1em" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" data-item="chevron-up" style="margin-top:-1px" class="StyledIconBase-sc-ea9ulj-0 devAbe"><polyline points="18 15 12 9 6 15"></polyline></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" height="1em" width="1em" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" data-item="chevron-down" class="StyledIconBase-sc-ea9ulj-0 devAbe"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></div></summary><div py="2" font-size="13px" color="black.600" class="sc-9f15bd04-0 sc-95a8602e-3 iNnNfP">The display name is public and the legal name is private, appearing on receipts, invoices, and other official documentation used for tax and accounting purposes.</div></details><div mt="2" pl="2" class="sc-9f15bd04-0 kHbQkv"><a href="https://documentation.opencollective.com/expenses-and-getting-paid/submitting-expenses" font-size="12px" color="black.700" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="sc-b5fbabe8-0 cxrQiD sc-b5fbabe8-0 cxrQiD">More info<!-- --> →</a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></main><footer class="flex-row border-t p-6 py-12"><div class="mx-auto flex w-full max-w-(--breakpoint-xl) flex-1 flex-col gap-8"><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"><div class="flex flex-col justify-between gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:items